msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His name was Jacopo. ⟪k:1⟫And though he dressed in such fine attire, I sincerely doubt he "
"understood how splendid the furnishings left in the mansion truly were."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫His name was Jacopo. ⟪k:1⟫And though he dressed in such fine attire, I sincerely doubt he "
"understood how splendid the furnishings left in the mansion truly were."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4F66D0E7_51E8_426F_BC2E_44990B4B075A
