"⟪k:0⟫He put his trust only in money, renown, and rank. ⟪k:1⟫He loved only the iron and steel that "
"had revolutionized so many industries."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫He put his trust only in money, renown, and rank. ⟪k:1⟫He loved only the iron and steel that "
